        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-1971P, Elite Collection Designer Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Designer Appliance Pull will be a stylish addition to any kitchen remodel. It has a sleek look that lends itself well to modern spaces. The Elite Collection Designer Appliance Handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from a wide array of finish colors. This Designer Refrigerator Pull comes packaged with the hardware to install it on an appliance panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia AP-1971P pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/designer-cabinet-pull-omnia-1971\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Designer Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-1971P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-11/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-1971P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-9/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
